      <h1>{h1}</h1>
      <p class="dek">A 2026 state of the industry report on fitness AI: where the money goes, what gyms use, and who owns the data.</p>
      <div class="byline">
        <span>Fitness x Marketing</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
